<h3 id="why-bother">Why bother</h3>

<p>Honestly? Because watching Life on a big window is oddly nice, and shipping a Mac build sounded more entertaining than an evening of doomscrolling. Same energy as the original: low stakes, slightly hypnotic, done when it feels done.</p>

<p>Enjoy some soothing cellular chaos on whichever device is closest. <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/gollygee/id6809184721">Check it out on the App Store.</a></p>

